# =============================================================
# Mosquitto ACL —— 最小权限
# =============================================================
# 约定：设备账号只能访问 room/{自己的 deviceCode}/#
#      后端账号可以访问 room/+/#（它要给所有设备下发指令）
#
# ★ 绝不能给设备配 room/# 或 #：一台设备被攻破就等于所有门失守。
# ★ 设备不得订阅别的设备主题，否则能读到别人的签到码。
# =============================================================

# ---------- 后端 ----------
user backend
topic readwrite room/+/snapshot
topic readwrite room/+/cmd
topic readwrite room/+/ack
topic readwrite room/+/heartbeat
topic readwrite room/+/event

# ---------- 研讨室A 门禁 ----------
user room-a
topic readwrite room/ROOM-A-01/#

# ---------- 研讨室B 门禁 ----------
user room-b
topic readwrite room/ROOM-B-01/#
